{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to \u201cUKNON Jones &amp; Guynelk \u2013 Awesome!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Jones' friends are rescued, he discovers that his grandfather has mysteriously disappeared. He was searching for a mythical treasure called the \u201cCrystal Cereals\u201d. Jones, Guynelk, Elsa LOVELUST and the princess Sapphire decide to go in search of the Crystal Cereal to find Jones' grandfather. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore an open world with magnificent graphics, alone or with a friend in split screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use the power of time to change the environment by traveling to the past or future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Face increasingly difficult bosses and discover their weak points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Participate in various mini-games or compete against your friends in this game created by one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Summon allies using a QR code to help you in this event-packed adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Go on romantic dates with certain characters in the game by giving them roses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The adventure can be experienced with four different characters: Jones, Guynelk, Elsa or Saphir, each with specific skills. For example, Jones can use bombs or a drone to stun enemies and monitor the surroundings. Guynelk masters elemental powers such as fire, ice and electricity. Elsa can fly and attack from a distance, while Saphir excels in sword techniques.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to: \"GYork\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/79237c1d816e9fc49cb91c2173cdd9f8bd7648b3.jpg"},{"name":" VS Reydun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/5bee730de828cd11057f3199a61d884d5a069ace.jpg"},{"name":"End of tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/aa5fe02044b8d08262416568839162cf9242f274.jpg"},{"name":"Beginning of wealth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/d7ab3879ee2c046d2f683ff3ff7194bb6241f833.jpg"},{"name":"First crystal key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/f612be499156b199172c90af3895353e58289e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Second key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/bfb25776963cebb45dd731d6d761d050daa40c3e.jpg"},{"name":"Third Crystal Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/bb161c77425d9170cce9713eb0b25cece8358a25.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Crystal Key","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/5d60db0e1de187464d02afb9c3d6bbec67a7e61c.jpg"},{"name":"Mythical treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/0e8757d90b6e87f3e1b6294305d8dd53ee46430e.jpg"},{"name":" 4 keys combined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2899300/02f2dce9db85536f360304f768cc742b40536e28.jpg"}],"total":80},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2899300?t=1772513475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/7c534bfafbb8b5b2ae87317a1072a8367e63fa8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772513475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/721c7c6a8e5e5c78fd45f9c964bc57c293eacd0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772513475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/721c7c6a8e5e5c78fd45f9c964bc57c293eacd0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772513475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri